# RL engine runtime state (PPO checkpoints, training status, pause/terminate
# control file). Deliberately anchored to TraffSim3D-backend/ instead of /tmp —
# on Windows /tmp is drive-relative, which split checkpoints across drives.
# See TraffSim3D-backend/app/apps/rl/paths.py.
TraffSim3D-backend/.data/

