# Generated by the CI e2e job on the fly (it moves the frontend to :5188).
# The workflow writes it at run time, so a local run of the same command
# would leave an untracked file behind.
TraffSim3D-frontend/playwright.ci.config.ts

# Cross-language contract test snapshots.
# The Python side regenerates its own on every run; the TS side's goldens# are committed so the backend suite can run the full contract standalone.
TraffSim3D-backend/tests/contract/snapshots/python_*.json

# Overpass response cache (large JSON files regenerated
# by the backend; user can `rm -rf` to force refresh from overpass-api.de)
TraffSim3D-backend/geojson/cache/

# ...EXCEPT the responses the demo city needs.
#
# The signal-node query for the bundled Shenzhen rectangle: without it
# `POST /maps/parse-sample` waits for overpass-api.de (up to the
# request's own budget) before the city can be served — and on a slow
# or restricted network that is 20+ seconds of a blank city, which is
# what broke the CI e2e run. 55 kB, ODbL, and it makes the offline demo
# offline in fact and not only in principle.
#
# The key is the hash of the query TEXT, so it changes when the
# rectangle changes (2026-11-12: the eastern edge reached the 春风隧道
# to bring the city a real height limit).
#
# The BUILDINGS response for the same rectangle — 5.9 MB, and without
# it a fresh clone has a city with no buildings whenever Overpass is
# unreachable (which is the normal case on a Chinese network).
!TraffSim3D-backend/geojson/cache/a7ff0b95fa6c15ec.json
!TraffSim3D-backend/geojson/cache/cf1958b56341418e.json

# Real-world map data files (large, downloaded/regenerable, not source):
# keep geojson2osm.py tool but ignore the .geojson / .osm data blobs
TraffSim3D-backend/geojson/*.geojson
TraffSim3D-backend/geojson/*.osm

# ...EXCEPT the one slice that IS the product's bundled asset.
#
# `福田中心(深圳).osm` (7.4 MB) is the offline demo city: the Smart City
# view parses it through `POST /maps/parse-sample` with no upload and no
# network, and the backend's own suite asserts on the parsed city
# (tests/test_api_maps_sample.py). Excluding it left a fresh clone with
# no city at all — the endpoint answered 500 and CI's parse-sample test
# failed on every run.
#
# The exclusion above was meant for the *regenerable* full-extract blobs
# (>10 MB), not for the slice the demo depends on. OSM data is ODbL;
# the attribution is in the README's licence section.
!TraffSim3D-backend/geojson/福田中心(深圳).osm

